  <!-- EN: When enabled, psykers suffering a mental breakdown will trigger psychic phenomena. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsychicPhenomena>启用时，精神崩溃的灵能者会引发灵能现象。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsychicPhenomena>
  <!-- EN: When a psychic phenomena occur and table is rolled on a random effect is chosen, these can wary from harmless to severely destructive. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsychicPhenomenaDesc>当灵能现象产生时，使用随机数选择一个效果，这些效果从无害到极具破坏性不等。。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsychicPhenomenaDesc>

  <!-- EN: When enabled, children may rarely and randomly be born as psykers or pariahs. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirth>启用时，儿童出生时有极小概率会成为灵能者或无魂者。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirth>
  <!-- EN: Chance for newly born children to be psykers or pariahs: {0}% -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirthChance>新生儿成为灵能者或无魂者的几率：{0}%</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirthChance>
  <!-- EN: Chance for newly born children to have a psyker or pariah gene. Parent genes have no effect on this. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirthChanceDesc>新生儿成为灵能者或无魂者的几率：{0}%。父母的基因对此没有影响。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PsykerPariahBirthChanceDesc>

  <!-- EN: When enabled, children may rarely and randomly be born as perpetuals. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PerpetualBirth>启用时，儿童出生时有极小概率会成为永生者。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PerpetualBirth>
  <!-- EN: Chance for newly born children to be a perpetual: {0}% -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PerpetualBirthChance>新生儿成为永生者的几率：{0}%</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.PerpetualBirthChance>
  <!-- EN: Chance for newly born children to have a perpetual gene. Parent genes have no effect on this. -->
