  <!-- EN: Enabling this will allow colonist being killed to resurrect as Living Saints. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSystem>允许将死亡的殖民者复活为活圣人。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSystem>
  <!-- EN: Living Saint pawn limit: {0} -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintPawnLimit>活圣人殖民者数量限制：{0}</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintPawnLimit>
  <!-- EN: This is the limit of how many Living Saints may exist at any time, both living and dead. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintPawnLimitDesc>这是活圣人的人数上限，包括还活着的和死了的。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintPawnLimitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Male colonists can become Living Saints -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintMale>男性殖民者可以成为活圣人。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintMale>
  <!-- EN: Only females can become Living Saints normally, this enables males to also be able to ascend. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintMaleDesc>通常只有女性殖民者可以成为活圣人，该选项可以让男性也能成为活圣人。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintMaleDesc>

  <!-- EN: Chances for a lost Living Saint to return in a time of threat to the colony. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintChance>角色死亡后成为活圣人的几率</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintChance>
  <!-- EN: Big threat: {0}% -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBigThreat>在面对大型威胁时死亡：{0}%</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBigThreat>
  <!-- EN: Chance for Living Saints to resurrect on a big threat raid. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBigThreatDesc>面对大规模袭击时重生为活圣人的几率。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBigThreatDesc>
  <!-- EN: Small threat: {0}% -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSmallThreat>在面对小型威胁时死亡：{0}%</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSmallThreat>
  <!-- EN: Chance for Living Saints to resurrect on a small threat raid. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSmallThreatDesc>面对小规模袭击时重生为活圣人的几率。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintSmallThreatDesc>

  <!-- EN: Living Saints base chance: {0}% -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBaseChance>成为活圣人的基础几率：{0}%</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBaseChance>
  <!-- EN: Other modifiers may increase beyond this, such as psysensitivity traits or violence skills if enabled. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBaseChanceDesc>其他修正值可能在此基础上增加，例如心灵敏感和或者战斗技能（如果启用了该选项）</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintBaseChanceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Extra chance to become living saint depending on shooting and melee skill. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintExtraChanceFromViolence>根据射击和近战技能成为活圣人的额外几率</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintExtraChanceFromViolence>
  <!-- EN: For each skill point in melee and/or shooting above 10 your pawn get higher chance to become a saint. -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintExtraChanceFromViolenceDesc>近战与射击技能每超过10点，殖民者成为活圣人的几率就会更高。</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintExtraChanceFromViolenceDesc>

  <!-- EN: Limit Living Saint ascension to baseliners -->
  <BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintAscensionLimit>重生为活圣人仅限人类</BEWH.MankindsFinest.ModSettings.LivingSaintAscensionLimit>
  <!-- EN: This limits the the Living Saint ascension system to only apply to baseliners.\nAny xenotype such as Impids will not be able to ascend. -->
